        "cooked": "<p>In the Galactic Strike Force core game, two Mission Cards have incorrect backs.</p><p>The UFGD Mission Card <em>Search and Seizure</em> should have <a title=\"Contraband Stockpile\" href=\"http://i.imgur.com/gzATrb0.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">this</a> back:</p><p>![Contraband Stockpile|600x814](upload://gwizF77Fy1i6wHFikHY6xsJM3lD.jpeg \"Contraband Stockpile\")</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Technovore Infestation Mission Card&nbsp;<em>The Space-Net Gambit</em> should have <a title=\"Netted Technovore\" href=\"http://i.imgur.com/VVY7CZE.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">this</a> back:</p><p><span alt=\"Netted Technovore\" title=\"This image is broken\" class=\"broken-image\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
